9 x \\arctan{\\left(y \\right)}- \\frac{3 x^{2}}{y^{3}}.$" :question/worked-solution "The notation ${f}_{y}$ denotes the partial derivative of $f$ with respect to $y.$\n\nWe differentiate the given function with respect to $y,$ treating all other variables as constants.\n\nAdditionally, we use the sum and constant multiple rules for differentiation, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{y}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(8 x^{4} \\sin{\\left(y \\right)}+9 x \\arctan{\\left(y \\right)}- \\frac{3 x^{2}}{y^{3}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(8 x^{4} \\sin{\\left(y \\right)})+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(9 x \\arctan{\\left(y \\right)})-\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\frac{3 x^{2}}{y^{3}}) \\\\  & =8 x^{4}\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\sin{\\left(y \\right)})+9 x\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\arctan{\\left(y \\right)})-3 x^{2}\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\frac{1}{y^{3}}) \\\\  & =8 x^{4}\\cdot \\cos{\\left(y \\right)}+9 x\\cdot \\frac{1}{y^{2} + 1}-3 x^{2}\\cdot (- \\frac{3}{y^{4}}) \\\\  & =8 x^{4} \\cos{\\left(y \\right)} + \\frac{9 x^{2}}{y^{4}} + \\frac{9 x}{y^{2} + 1}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["1656178c-d374-56ef-bdd1-26d275bae562"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "86904204-2b1a-5604-96a0-fe1dacd76618" :answer/id #uuid "86904204-2b1a-5604-96a0-fe1dacd76618" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{9 x^{4}}{y} + \\frac{24 x^{2}}{y^{5}} + 6 e^{y}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "4e86ebca-d073-5614-920c-2c40368c5855" :answer/id #uuid "4e86ebca-d073-5614-920c-2c40368c5855" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{9 x^{4}}{y} - \\frac{24 x^{2}}{y^{5}} + 6 x e^{y}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "5e528259-2bf2-593c-ad87-b336511c725f" :answer/id #uuid "5e528259-2bf2-593c-ad87-b336511c725f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "36 x^{3} \\ln{\\left(y \\right)} - \\frac{12 x}{y^{4}} + 6 e^{y}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ad0ad5bb-cac7-5166-853a-00283b9beefc" :answer/id #uuid "ad0ad5bb-cac7-5166-853a-00283b9beefc" :ans