c{9 x^{2}}{y^{2}}.$" :question/worked-solution "The notation ${f}_{y}$ denotes the partial derivative of $f$ with respect to $y.$\n\nWe differentiate the given function with respect to $y,$ treating all other variables as constants.\n\nAdditionally, we use the sum and constant multiple rules for differentiation, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{y}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(3 x^{4} \\ln{\\left(y \\right)}+2 x e^{y}- \\frac{9 x^{2}}{y^{2}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(3 x^{4} \\ln{\\left(y \\right)})+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(2 x e^{y})-\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\frac{9 x^{2}}{y^{2}}) \\\\  & =3 x^{4}\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\ln{\\left(y \\right)})+2 x\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂y}(e^{y})-9 x^{2}\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\frac{1}{y^{2}}) \\\\  & =3 x^{4}\\cdot \\frac{1}{y}+2 x\\cdot e^{y}-9 x^{2}\\cdot (- \\frac{2}{y^{3}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{3 x^{4}}{y} + \\frac{18 x^{2}}{y^{3}} + 2 x e^{y}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["2d5a7b03-c824-563d-a453-efaa5a4681b0"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "3addf247-3600-5696-a597-18ce1d4fe1a1" :answer/id #uuid "3addf247-3600-5696-a597-18ce1d4fe1a1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4 y e^{x} + \\frac{3 y^{4}}{x} - \\frac{2 y^{2}}{x^{3}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "79b0c26f-a5e2-52d4-96e9-f00d28e2adb5" :answer/id #uuid "79b0c26f-a5e2-52d4-96e9-f00d28e2adb5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3 y^{4} \\ln{\\left(x \\right)} + 4 y e^{x} + \\frac{2 y^{2}}{x^{3}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "74a37371-78a7-5f96-a731-2d709ec5223c" :answer/id #uuid "74a37371-78a7-5f96-a731-2d709ec5223c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4 e^{x} + \\frac{3 y^{4}}{x} + \\frac{2 y^{2}}{x^{3}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "299bed61-393a-57ef-bc40-e403263bea41" :answer/id #uuid "299bed61-393a-57ef-bc40-e403263bea41" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4 y e^{x} + \\frac{3 y^{4}}{x} + \\frac{2 y^{2}}{x^{3}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "34a0345d-a500-541a-9f